<title>USA: IDT sees Q4 revenues ahead of estimates.</title>
<headline>IDT sees Q4 revenues ahead of estimates.</headline>
<dateline>HACKENSACK, N.J. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>IDT Corp said Tuesday that it expects its telecom revenues for the fiscal fourth quarter ending on July 31 to show a significant gain over the previous quarter's $26.1 million and its revenues will exceed current analysts' estimates.</p>
<p>It did not give details.</p>
<p>Current analysts' estimates for fiscal fourth quarter earnings are $0.05 a share, according to First Call.</p>
